      "writtenOn": "2024-09-27T19:29:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t have a brask to test with, so I flashed this change on to a Nipperkin and ran `suspend_stress_test` without issues.\n\n```\nnipperkin-rev4 ~ # suspend_stress_test -c 100 --suspend_min 20 --wake_min 20\n...\nFinished 100 iterations.\nPremature wakes: 0\nLate wakes: 0\nSuspend failures: 0\nHwrng errors: 0\nWakealarm errors: 0\nFirmware log errors: 0\nEC detected AP suspend errors: 0\ns0ix errors: 0\ns0ix substate errors: 0\ns0ix pc10 errors: 0\n```\n\nI\u0027m going to mark this Verified and land the CL so we can (hopefully) start getting some feedback to inform next steps for b/353831728.",
      "revId": "c71170440a05154ae4bbb90768d34f3eac8c63b2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    }
